 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources. Sorting triangles adds $O(N \log N)$ where $N$ is the number of triangles [S2].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources. Memory usage is bounded by $m\_MemoryLimit$ plus the overhead of the SVO structure being built, as it processes partitions sequentially and does not store the full global voxel grid in memory [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Time Complexity:** Not given in the sources [S1, unofficial][S2]. Sorting triangles adds $O(N \log N)$ where $N$ is the number of triangles [S2].
+*   **Memory Complexity:** Not given in the sources [S1, unofficial][S2]. Memory usage is bounded by $m\_MemoryLimit$ plus the overhead of the SVO structure being built, as it processes partitions sequentially and does not store the full global voxel grid in memory [S1, unofficial].
 *   **Strengths:** Handles large meshes that do not fit in memory; Morton ordering ensures spatial locality which is efficient for cache and SVO construction [S1, unofficial][S2].
 *   **Limitations:** Requires careful tuning of $gridSize$ and $m\_MemoryLimit$ [S1, unofficial]. Batch determination requires predicting voxel counts per triangle, which may be approximate [S2].
